# Build artifacts
**/target/
**/.mvn/

# IDE / OS
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/*.iml
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Secrets — never ship .env into an image
**/.env

# Tests (already excluded by -DskipTests, but keeps context lean)
**/src/test/

# Git
**/.git/
**/.gitignore
**/.gitattributes

# Docker files themselves (not needed inside the build)
*.Dockerfile
docker-compose.yml
.env.example
README.md